# ── OS files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Editor & IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ── Logs & temp files ─────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
npm-debug.log*

# ── Node (not used, but guard against accidental init) ────
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# ── Build output (not used, guard only) ───────────────────
dist/
build/

# ── Environment / secrets (never commit these) ────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ── NOTE: .kiro/ is intentionally NOT ignored ─────────────
# It contains project specs and steering files required
# for the RevoU submission and Kiro IDE configuration.
